almanac-blade-examine-abilities = [color=lightblue]It deals 10 damage, swinging somewhere between a fireaxe and a knife depending on the phase of the moon, and as fast as the throngler during an eclipse.
    It can only be wide swung on a Wednesday.
    After noon it sets people on fire. Before noon it deals 5 extra cold damage.
    On a leap day it deals no damage at all, because a leap day is not a real day.
    On Christmas it sings hallelujah and hands out presents every 3 minutes, until 666 ores have been processed.
    On a Tuesday it's user can blink, as long as the crew has done no more than 19 flips this round.
    On Saturdays after Easter it plays hard bass to anyone in Russia holding it.
    On April Fools, after noon, it explodes.[/color]
almanac-blade-examine-does-not = [color=lightblue]It does not make lasagna.
    It does not deal damage on the 30th of February.
    It does not play hard bass outside of Russia.
    It does not wide swing on a Thursday.
    It does not love you. [/color]
